# Zenith API origin.
#
# Leave empty to call the API on the site's own origin. Production is served
# from zenith.csui.dev, the same origin as the API, so this is the normal case
# and no CORS is involved.
#
# The API grants no Access-Control-Allow-Origin to any origin, so a cross-origin
# browser call fails. Set this only where CORS does not apply: the Astro build,
# a server route, or behind your own proxy that adds the headers.
#
# Example: PUBLIC_ZENITH_API_URL=http://43.173.10.71
PUBLIC_ZENITH_API_URL=
